    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LV} Gif hwa his agenne geleod bebycgge, ðeowne oððe frigne, ðeah he scyldig sie, ofer sæ, forgielde hine his were.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone sells over the sea his own countryman, slave or free, even though he is guilty [of an offense], let him compensate by payment of his [own] wer.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone sells one of his own countrymen bond or free over the sea, even though he be guilty, he shall pay for him with his wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa his agenne leod gebycge, ðeowne oððe frigne, ðeah he scyldig sy, ofer sǽ, gesylle, forgilde hine be his were.</ab>
      </div>
